        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NBA 2K16, NBA 2K17\n- People: Tony Parker, Dennis Schröder, Marc Gasol, Pau Gasol\n- Organizations: Take-Two Interactive, 2K Games, 2K Sports, Social Point\n- Teams: San Antonio Spurs, Atlanta Hawks, Memphis Grizzlies, Chicago Bulls\n- Roles: cover athlete, point guard\n- Topics: NBA 2K franchise\n\nFacts:\n- NBA 2K16 has Tony Parker of the San Antonio Spurs as the cover athlete for the French version.\n- NBA 2K16 has Dennis Schröder of the Atlanta Hawks as the cover athlete for the German version.\n- NBA 2K16 has Marc Gasol of the Memphis Grizzlies and Pau Gasol of the Chicago Bulls as the cover athletes for the Spanish version.\n- Dennis Schröder plays the point guard position.\n- NBA 2K17 is the 18th installment in the NBA 2K franchise.\n- NBA 2K17 is the successor to NBA 2K16.\n- Take-Two Interactive owns 2K Games.\n- Take-Two Interactive publishes 2K Sports titles through 2K Games.\n- Take-Two Interactive creates free-to-play mobile titles through Social Point.",
